# css-visual-diff script verb smoke

## root help
Compare rendered HTML/CSS across browser targets

Usage:
  css-visual-diff [command]

Available Commands:
  chromedp-probe Run a minimal chromedp probe against a URL
  compare        Compare a single element between two URLs (screenshots + CSS + pixel diff)
  completion     Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help           Help about any command
  run            Run css-visual-diff capture and analysis modes
  script         All commands for script

Flags:
  -h, --help                          help for css-visual-diff
      --log-file string               Log file (default: stderr)
      --log-format string             Log format (json, text) (default "text")
      --log-level string              Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error, fatal) (default "error")
      --log-to-stdout                 Log to stdout even when log-file is set
      --logstash-app-name string      Application name for Logstash logs (default "css-visual-diff")
      --logstash-enabled              Enable logging to Logstash
      --logstash-environment string   Environment name for Logstash logs (development, staging, production) (default "development")
      --logstash-host string          Logstash host (default "logstash")
      --logstash-port int             Logstash port (default 5044)
      --logstash-protocol string      Logstash protocol (tcp, udp) (default "tcp")
      --with-caller                   Log caller information

Use "css-visual-diff [command] --help" for more information about a command.

## script compare brief help
Render a concise text brief for one compared region

Usage:
  css-visual-diff script compare brief <question> [flags]

Flags:
      --config-file string     Explicit config file path to load via middlewares - <string>
      --height int             Viewport height - <int> (default 720)
  -h, --help                   help for brief
      --leftSelector string    Selector on the left target - <string>
      --leftUrl string         Left target URL - <string>
      --leftWaitMs int         Wait after left navigation in milliseconds - <int>
      --outDir string          Output directory for artifacts (default: generated timestamped directory) - <string>
      --print-parsed-fields    Print the parsed fields - <bool>
      --print-schema           Print the command's schema - <bool>
      --print-yaml             Print the command's YAML - <bool>
      --rightSelector string   Selector on the right target (defaults to leftSelector) - <string>
      --rightUrl string        Right target URL - <string>
      --rightWaitMs int        Wait after right navigation in milliseconds - <int>
      --threshold int          Pixel diff threshold (0-255) - <int> (default 30)
      --width int              Viewport width - <int> (default 1280)
      --writeJson              Write compare.json when supported by the host verb - <bool>
      --writeMarkdown          Write compare.md when supported by the host verb - <bool>
      --writePngs              Write screenshots and diff PNGs - <bool> (default true)

Global Flags:
      --log-file string               Log file (default: stderr)
      --log-format string             Log format (json, text) (default "text")
      --log-level string              Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error, fatal) (default "error")
      --log-to-stdout                 Log to stdout even when log-file is set
      --logstash-app-name string      Application name for Logstash logs (default "css-visual-diff")
      --logstash-enabled              Enable logging to Logstash
      --logstash-environment string   Environment name for Logstash logs (development, staging, production) (default "development")
      --logstash-host string          Logstash host (default "logstash")
      --logstash-port int             Logstash port (default 5044)
      --logstash-protocol string      Logstash protocol (tcp, udp) (default "tcp")
      --with-caller                   Log caller information

## script compare brief execution
What should change?
- Visual drift is 33.05% of pixels at threshold 30.
- Change `padding-top` from `12px` to `10px`.
- Change `padding-right` from `20px` to `16px`.
- Change `padding-bottom` from `12px` to `10px`.
- Change `padding-left` from `20px` to `16px`.
- Change `border-radius` from `8px` to `0px`.
- Change `background-color` from `rgb(96, 45, 72)` to `rgb(112, 61, 89)`.
